[00:19.29]1. There is a way of peace,
[00:22.29]The way you’ve come to know.
[00:25.29]It is the way you learned,
[00:31.29]The way of long ago,
[00:33.29]The way that Jesus taught you
[00:35.29]When his voice you heard.
[00:37.29]This is the way of peace,
[00:38.96]Found in Jehovah’s Word.
[00:40.62](Chorus)
[00:41.56]This is the way to life; This is the way.
[00:49.56]Don’t look aside; Not for a moment stray!
[00:55.56]God’s voice is calling: ‘This is the way;
[01:01.56]Do not look back, for yes, this is the way.’
[01:06.91]2. There is a way of love,
[01:20.06]No need to look around.
[01:23.13]God’s voice has shown the way
[01:26.20]He lets himself be found.
[01:29.26]His love is full and good;
[01:32.32]His love is warm and true.
[01:42.67]This is the way of love;
[01:44.55]It touches all we do.
[01:46.43](Chorus)
[01:48.31]This is the way to life; This is the way.
[01:50.19]Don’t look aside; Not for a moment stray!
[01:56.23]God’s voice is calling: ‘This is the way;
[02:07.77]Do not look back, for yes, this is the way.’
[02:20.92]3. There is a way of life,
[02:23.92]No need to look behind.
[02:26.92]Our God has promised us:
[02:29.92]No better way we’ll find,
[02:32.92]No higher way to peace,
[02:39.02]No finer way to love.
[02:45.12]This is the way to life,
[02:46.62]Thanks to our God above.
[02:48.12](Chorus)
[02:49.62]This is the way to life; This is the way.
[02:51.12]Don’t look aside; Not for a moment stray!
[02:57.12]God’s voice is calling: ‘This is the way;
[03:06.52]Do not look back, for yes, this is the way.’